"pipeline lying on or buried under the seabed or the land."
msgstr ""

#: C:\Users\simon\git\beautified-JOSM-preset\build\temp/v4.xml:5207(list_entry:short_description|group:Shipping|preset:Seamark|value:oil_barrier)
